{
  "name": "Tool - Leer Correos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🧩 Sub-agente: Leer Correos (Tool)\n\nQué hace:\n- Se ejecuta como *tool* desde el Agente principal.\n- Entrada: `cantidad` (opcional, default 5) y `filtro` (opcional, una query estilo Gmail, ej. `is:unread`).\n- Lee correos recientes y devuelve `resultado` (string) ya formateado para Telegram.\n\nImportante:\n- Aquí NO se envía nada a Telegram. Solo se regresa texto al agente.\n- Si quieres solo no leídos, el agente manda `filtro = \"is:unread\"`.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 540
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-16, 288],
      "id": "n1-overview-correos",
      "name": "🟨 Nota - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "jsonExample",
        "jsonExample": "{\n  \"cantidad\": 5,\n  \"filtro\": \"is:unread\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "n2-trigger-correos",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "name": "When Executed by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "position": [592, 352]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-cantidad",
              "name": "cantidad",
              "value": "={{ $json.cantidad || 5 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-filtro",
              "name": "filtro",
              "value": "={{ $json.filtro || 'is:unread' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [848, 352],
      "id": "n3-preparar-correos",
      "name": "Preparar Filtros"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": "={{ $json.cantidad }}",
        "simple": true,
        "filters": {
          "q": "={{ $json.filtro }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1072, 352],
      "id": "n4-gmail-getall",
      "name": "Leer Correos",
      "webhookId": "tool-leer-correos",
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "PEGA_TU_CREDENCIAL_GMAIL",
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "correos",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1296, 352],
      "id": "n5-agrupar-correos",
      "name": "Agrupar Correos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "format-correos",
              "name": "resultado",
              "value": "=📧 Correos ({{ $('Preparar Filtros').item.json.filtro }}):\n\n{{ $json.correos.length === 0 ? 'No hay correos que coincidan.' : $json.correos.map((c, i) => `${i+1}. De: ${c.from ?? c.From ?? 'desconocido'}\\n   Asunto: ${c.subject ?? c.Subject ?? '(sin asunto)'}\\n   ${c.snippet ?? ''}`).join('\\n\\n') }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1520, 352],
      "id": "n6-respuesta-correos",
      "name": "Formatear Respuesta"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "When Executed by Another Workflow": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Preparar Filtros", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Preparar Filtros": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Leer Correos", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Leer Correos": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Agrupar Correos", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Agrupar Correos": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Formatear Respuesta", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
